file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the fifty-line body lifted in as one published function taking the rung as a comptime type parameter
file caravan/apprise.rye one of seventeen rungs whose fifty-line body became a three-line stub
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish ceiling lowered to 78934, the bodies assert re-measured, and both prose lines rewritten to what this lap measured
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh the scan's own default ceiling lowered to match
recommend keep-going the queue's next head by realized fall is renew_path at thirty-one rungs by twenty-seven lines over a one-line signature, about 720 -- yet it stands private in all thirty-one and would be the first fold in eight to widen a declaration, so weigh that before taking it. lost_published at forty by twenty (about 663) is the head that widens nothing and is the safer next fold. Then ask_path at thirty-one by twenty-five (about 660, private in all thirty-one), press_path at twenty-eight by twenty-seven (about 648), bearing_published at thirty-nine by twenty (about 646). Beside them the booked reader_path merge would fold hand_path and tell_path into one body taking suffix and companion as comptime parameters; that is its own round across sixty-three rungs. The machine half of the address space stays owed, and the libsel4 generator gate (jinja2, ply) is still Keaton's word.
